+//! Browser/Electron-side redirected drive (filesystem) backend for RDPDR (`MS-RDPEFS`).
+//!
+//! Architecture mirrors [`crate::printer`] and [`crate::clipboard`]:
+//!
+//! * [`WasmDriveBackend`] lives inside the `Rdpdr` static virtual channel processor
+//!   (which must be `Send`). It forwards incoming [`ServerDriveIoRequest`]s to the
+//!   session event loop via `mpsc::UnboundedSender<RdpInputEvent>` and tracks
+//!   pending IRPs by `(device_id, completion_id)` so completions, resets, and
+//!   dynamic drive removals stay protocol-consistent.
+//! * When a virtual printer is also configured in the same session,
+//!   [`WasmDriveBackend`] composes [`WasmPrinterBackend`] and delegates all
+//!   printer IRPs to it on the single `rdpdr` static channel.
+//! * The session event loop converts incoming drive requests to plain JS objects
+//!   for `rdpdr_request_callback` and encodes JS responses submitted via
+//!   `Session.invokeExtension("rdpdr_response", ...)` into [`RdpdrPdu`] frames.
+
